> 
>    `touch' changes the access and/or modification times of the
> specified
>    files.  Synopsis:
> 
>         touch [OPTION]... FILE...
> 
>       Any FILE that does not exist is created empty.
> 
> 
> It was put there so that the outcome of "touch filename" is
> predictable: after execution there WILL be a file there and it WILL
> have a current lastmodified timestamp, and if the file existed before
